    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Можно тебя на минуточку?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Can I have a word with you for a minute?' Vika approaches the new owner Kristina and politely asks for a quick word.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Я слушаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am listening.' Kristina invites Vika to go ahead and speak.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Ты много сделала.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You have done a lot.' Before Vika can say much, Kristina acknowledges all the work Vika has done here.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Но это прошлое.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But this is the past.' However, Kristina waves that history away as belonging to the past.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Нам нужны новые люди.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We need new people.' She declares that the restaurant needs fresh faces on the team.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Новая кровь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'New blood.' Kristina calls it bringing in 'new blood' to shake things up.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Вы меня увольняете?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you firing me?' Realizing where this is headed, Vika asks bluntly if Kristina is firing her.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Да.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yes.' Kristina confirms it with a cold, single-word 'yes'.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Я надеюсь, ты найдешь работу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I hope you will find a job.' She adds a hollow wish that Vika will find another job soon.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Не волнуйтесь за меня.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not worry about me.' Keeping her pride, Vika tells Kristina not to worry about her future. And Kristina jumps in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kristina",
      "t": "Хорошо, не буду.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Okay, I won't.' Kristina breezy replies that she will not worry at all.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "До свидания.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
